    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I've been looking over the FluxCore due diligence folder you uploaded. The founders' pitch was incredible—they're claiming they've hit a massive inflection point with exponential user growth over the last two quarters. \n\nI'm leaning towards this one, but I need to be sure the numbers actually back up that \"exponential\" narrative they're pushing. Can you go through the user acquisition and retention datasets and let me know if the data supports their claim of rapid, accelerating growth?",
