    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Linear growth might just be the setup for the bigger jump they promised. If you look closely at the segment data—specifically the high-value enterprise users versus the general consumer base—is it possible that the \"exponential\" part is happening in the more profitable segments, even if the total user count looks linear right now? I don't want to miss the forest for the trees here.",
