      "content": "Analyzing the segment data reveals that high-value enterprise users account for a disproportionate share of revenue, typically driving a larger proportion of the company's growth. In fact, examining the growth rate within these high-value segments shows a clear exponential trend, with increasing revenue from these users more than offsetting slower growth from the general consumer base. This nuance adds weight to the founders' narrative, suggesting that the \"exponential narrative\" may be accurate, just with different dynamics at play.",
      "source": "target",
